{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "b9af44e2c35c1bf6c632ed657760b1a1937950301b11e17b4f770c81a18859d2", "ja": "迷子と策士", "zh": "迷路的孩子与策士", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c94121b51df8bf0fb482b67e4c9b4e316fa1cbed6166ef67885444e13ca744d4", "ja": "仕事の待ち合わせ場所へ向かう途中、迷子に\nなってしまったあずさと麗花。しかし瑞希は\nこんな時のため、あずさの携帯に迷子防止用\nのGPSアプリを入れておいたと言い、無事\n位置情報の特定に成功する。", "zh": "在前往工作碰头地点的路上，あずさ和丽花迷了路。  \n瑞希说，为了应对这种情况，她事先在あずさ的手机上安装了防迷路用的GPS应用，顺利确定了她们的位置。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1000_null", "source_sha256": "641be2e79405f3f0b2950a7b100b01130f9becd3246ade82c92148e558f36d24", "ja": "関東圏、某所……", "zh": "关东地区，某处……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "3d1d1750e3215387d4211215905606a1a34f262310e90083505334123f7b922a", "ja": "あら～？　あらあら～……？\nねえ麗花ちゃん、ここって、どこかしら～？", "zh": "哎呀～？哎呀哎呀～……？\n丽花，这里是哪里呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "caf85fa2c0e0e36cf36bc0151d398a8d267b04dbbecd2756bee98ed094b0656b", "ja": "あれれ？　さっきまで町中だったはずなのにな～。\nあっ、あずささん見て！　おっきなキノコ！", "zh": "咦？刚才明明还在市区的呀～\n啊，梓小姐你看！好大的蘑菇！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "57aa1f2ee118befbc2034a7025bfc2b3c24a13e91bf02ced5bd894fba21d6e30", "ja": "まあ！　とってもおいしそう……\nって、それどころじゃないわよ～、麗花ちゃん。", "zh": "哎呀！看起来真好吃……\n不对，现在可不是想这个的时候啦～，丽花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "b16dd39b22ac7d4f75998b56d5c293160404f6c7e435f8528d7e756ebcd15712", "ja": "待ち合わせ場所に急がないと。\nきっともうみんな、集まっちゃってるわ～。", "zh": "我们得赶快去碰头地点才行。\n大家肯定都已经聚齐了呀～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "1c0d1d919a9c9637a4c866bfc11d21f22d318475f43314703cd4553736bad2b8", "ja": "うーん……あっ、なんかあの道っぽいかも！\nあずささん、車に戻りましょう。ゴーゴー♪", "zh": "嗯……啊，那条路好像就是呢！\n梓小姐，我们回车里吧。出发出发♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "a9f925b33af294c7f5fe7d211e01fb98397e401d2e271297b0ff4b62afdb684b", "ja": "あ、あら～？　あっちで合ってるのかしら……？\n麗花ちゃん、待って～。", "zh": "啊，咦～？那边是对的吗……？\n丽花，等等我～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "fc035ceaee5a4a9d5452207aa539a83f2877b097d5811c712ab14c62fa41c8bd", "ja": "{$P$}。\n三浦さんと北上さんは、まだでしょうか？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n三浦小姐和北上小姐还没来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0fe259479ffe55ce35fb3767b639aa708976c47ce59c1abaa1c0aef3798ea284", "ja": "そうだな、もうじき待ち合わせ時間なのに。\nこれは、まさか……。", "zh": "是啊，明明马上就到约好的时间了。\n这难道是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "635db1192573bd2bc5082900a2bd54df384a1989f73596c07a8350177093b71e", "ja": "もしかして、迷子なんかなぁ？\n確か、麗花さんの運転って言ってたけども。", "zh": "该不会是迷路了吧？\n我记得说是丽花小姐开车来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "5c7b43c38625550e19581bfdad598e5c60e837e22d90ab4b6cad6fb7d7679140", "ja": "ここまで一本道なのに、迷うことなんて……。\nはっ！？　なにかミステリーの香りが！", "zh": "明明一路都是直路，怎么可能会迷路……  \n啊！？难道有一股神秘事件的气息！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a4476877f4b8cb1ad50d00f9fc9b74222c78f5a30637432aa443b8d03991a17d", "ja": "うーん……よし、電話してみるか。", "zh": "嗯……好，打个电话试试。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1013_null", "source_sha256": "c61cb6ccf0d59f2aaed33adba56d954ebe7a4104b9650a6bcbaae507c224311c", "ja": "プルルルル、プルルル……。", "zh": "嘟噜噜噜、嘟噜噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "73e818ce3d1271eaf386ea7915a20ecfc44d6794b82a8f0b32a9287c87cbcc52", "ja": "あら、{$P$}さん！\n今、ちょうど電話しようと思っていたところで……。", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}先生！\n我正好也想给你打电话来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "6f506ceb806d9ed93fb576e36c7b337217e1696278d4c22359aa8cd87483e373", "ja": "お疲れさまでーす！\n今、あずささんと私で、迷子の大冒険中なんですよ。", "zh": "辛苦啦——！\n我现在正和梓小姐一起，进行迷路大冒险呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7623baa5c9594c47fe32302b596a2f402edcfd4e52bd481b667f374bb4506493", "ja": "ああ、やっぱり……。すぐに迎えに行きます。\nどの辺にいるかわかりますか？", "zh": "啊，果然……我马上去接你们。\n知道你们大概在哪儿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "4e7cc2b2ccd6201bb403afcd13ab6527769adaf19626e49b5c785a9555089070", "ja": "それが、目印になるものが全然なくて……。\n困っているんです～。", "zh": "可是，这里完全没有能作为标志的东西……我正发愁呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "7be4c229da38994cb84b8b7a1dacda57031a5ee9cddf05d40fdeab6dc31f90cf", "ja": "むむ……ここはどうやら、私の出番のようですね。\n……頭脳派、真壁瑞希です。", "zh": "唔唔……看来这里该轮到我出场了呢。\n……头脑派，真壁瑞希登场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "3d75bb1a3b746e45a3f4cecb05612db1b9bb9eff1c9b75da0dff355adb0983db", "ja": "瑞希さん、どうしたんだい？", "zh": "瑞希，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "a61d6f1a072b00155945e76370d77dddfead48ce05e28f9ac8471dd76414ee73", "ja": "三浦さん。通話を切ったら、以前一緒に\nインストールしたアプリを立ち上げてください。", "zh": "三浦小姐。挂断电话后，请打开之前一起安装的应用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "a4ff6e5e4ec063f532e5a11e3a6192c6e69629a8b1f3bac506d22af76642e5cc", "ja": "こんなこともあろうかと……迷子防止用の、\nGPSアプリです。位置情報が特定できます……ぶい。", "zh": "为了防止发生这种事……这是防止迷路用的GPS应用。可以确定位置……嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "eba46e2be2d871dae93578bab63280aad184ec2ac334ef0a56484f71f380a789", "ja": "え、ええっ！？　そんな伏線を張っていたなんて……。\n瑞希さん、すごいです！", "zh": "诶、诶诶！？没想到之前居然埋下了这样的伏笔……瑞希小姐，真厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "21a6ea878fdcf16db04bda201041dc78c25b9d641f3bad4ca7c6649d705c54de", "ja": "本当だねぇ。スパイ映画を観ているみたいだよぉ。", "zh": "真的呢。就像是在看间谍电影一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1025_p", "source_sha256": "d2732a4494b735bdfbaefa76a8f89e2f84e7ab7612a2d5f4f1b7037ca356735e", "ja": "……おっ、メールが来たぞ！\nええと……うわ、なんでこんなところに！？", "zh": "……哦，邮件来了！\n呃……哇，怎么会在这种地方！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1026_026yur", "source_sha256": "49c77a01bb2b7d1f14a9cd6cbc4dbe1f6699ddbac4be8409258468214c11c4c2", "ja": "施設の下見は後にして、みんなで迎えに行きましょう。\n仲間が揃ってからが、真の冒険の始まりです！", "zh": "先把场地的预先考察放一放，大家一起去接她吧。\n等同伴到齐之后，真正的冒险才算开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_06_1027_p", "source_sha256": "0007d3d67a766483f47340aeddc2bbec477f0a1d999910ea22e90751dd0a48e7", "ja": "（これくらいのトラブルは、難なく\n乗り切れるようだ……みんな、頼もしくなったな）", "zh": "（看来这种程度的麻烦，她们都能轻松克服……大家变得可靠多了啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
